        <mxCell id="status" value="STATUS DAN INDEKS&#10;submitted -&gt; received -&gt; verifying -&gt; in_progress -&gt; completed&#10;verifying -&gt; rejected (alasan wajib). Ini aturan aplikasi, bukan ENUM database.&#10;IDX reports: created_at; (guest_access_id,created_at); (status,created_at); (type,created_at).&#10;IDX history: (report_id,created_at). IDX attachments: (attachable_type,attachable_id)." style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=15;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=14;fontColor=#334155;fillColor=#EFF6FF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
